         (Pragmatic.Endpoints) from the response and writes it with FileResponseExtensions
         (Pragmatic.Endpoints.AspNetCore). Test-only: Composition.Host itself stays Endpoints-free. -->
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\Pragmatic.Endpoints\src\Pragmatic.Endpoints\Pragmatic.Endpoints.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\Pragmatic.Endpoints\src\Pragmatic.Endpoints.AspNetCore\Pragmatic.Endpoints.AspNetCore.csproj" />
    <!-- The framework types the DI validator treats as provided (WellKnownFrameworkTypesTests): the tests
         name them with typeof, so a type that moves breaks the test, not the diagnostic. -->
